  "question": {
    "text": "An aluminium rod with Young&rsquo;s modulus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> undergoes elastic strain of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. The energy per unit volume stored in the rod in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>SI</mi></math> unit"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2800</mn></math>",
